spec: approvals
run: MCApprovals.tla
config: Approvals.cfg
check: OwnerOnly
kind: invariant
code: src/daemon.ts route(): the refusal of approve/deny on the "http" channel unless channels.http.allowApprovals is gone (commit 81f48ef reverted): anything holding the HTTP token, the agent's own tools included, can approve
@@@ old
           passesHttp  == p # "http" \/ AllowHttpApprovals      \* refused over HTTP unless allowed
@@@ new
           passesHttp  == TRUE      \* refused over HTTP unless allowed
@@@ end
